<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100371" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεράω</span></b>  (B), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>love jointly</i> or <i>together with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σοὶ καὶ ξυνήρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Andr.</u>
					223
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρή σε . . μοι τὠραμένῳ συνερᾶν
					ἀδόλως σέθεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					29.32
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύν μοι πῖνε, συνήβα, συνέρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Scol.</u>
					22
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Ages.</u>
				20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Alex.</u>
				41
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Procop.
			</span></i> Gaz. <i><span class="en">
				p.164
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ Συνερῶσα</span>, play by
			Menander. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			 and 
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλὸν δέ τ᾽ ἐρασσαμένῳ συνερᾶσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Bion
					<u>Fr.</u>
					8.8
				</span></i>
			 codd. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συναρέσθαι</span> is prob.
			cj.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅσα συνηράσθησαν</span> what
				<i>loves they had enjoyed together</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				51.8
			</span></i>.</div>
